            "textDisplay": "For me a recreational jogger (195 lbs), who will wear one shoe all day long after a run and/or workout, I am enjoying both the Novablast 6 and NB 1080 v15 and am having a hard time deciding which one I prefer out of the two.  The Novablast 6 feels more substantial and higher stacked and a bit more propulsive than 1080 v15, but the 1080 feels softer and smoother. 1080 has better upper & Novablast 6 has better outsole grip.  Both are very comfortable and both are keepers.",
